            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Symbol of Rebellion</strong><br>\nGuevara's image has become a universal symbol of rebellion and anti-imperialism, depicted in a variety of posters, t-shirts, and other media.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Criticism and Controversy</strong><br>\nGuevara's legacy is controversial; some hail him as a hero, while others criticize him for contributing to authoritarianism and for his role in executions post-revolution.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Posthumous Influence</strong><br>\nDespite his death, Che Guevara's writings and life story continue to inspire political activists around the world, embodying the spirit of resistance against oppression.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
